          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does Office Moving include?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Office Moving is a complete office relocation — desks and workstations, files and records runs, and office equipment — planned and quoted flat. Full or partial packing for offices is part of the service, staging at our warehouse covers the gap when the dates do not line up neatly, and placement at the new site runs in the order your team needs it: planned as a sequence with you, staged when the dates require it, and placed at the new address in the order your team needs to work. The Flat Rate Movers, 116 W Piccadilly St Suite 11, Winchester, VA 22601. Hours: Mon-Fri 8-6, Sat 8-4, Sun 9-4. Phone +1-540-422-2153. Winchester service areas (Google Business Profile, 17): Bristow, Leesburg, Marshall, Sterling, Stephens City, Loudoun County, Berryville 22611, Frederick County, Middleburg 20117, Middletown 22645, Moorefield 26836, Round Hill 20141, Stephenson 22656, Upperville 20184, Winchester 22601, Purcellville 20132, South Riding 20152."
